-- allium: 3
--
-- rovo — the root module
--
-- Scope
--   The product is undefined. This is its root module: the place the first
--   specification change will define what rovo does. Until then it holds
--   no behaviour, and the API (`rovo.__version__`) and the command
--   (`rovo --version`, `rovo version`) are placeholders that no clause
--   here describes.
--
-- Includes
--   Nothing yet.
--
-- Excludes
--   Every behaviour, until a specification change defines one. A ticket
--   or a decision record may introduce the change; this module, not the
--   code, is where the behaviour is then stated.
--
-- Dependencies
--   None.
--
-- Vocabulary
--   None yet. docs/project/terminology.md is the glossary; the first
--   specification change adds the product's terms there and here.
